WEBVTT

00:28:58.246 --> 00:29:00.704
It's difficult to predict where
it shows up the most.

00:29:00.704 --> 00:29:02.954
I think previous predictions
have mostly been wrong,

00:29:03.746 --> 00:29:09.454
but I I'd like to see us all as a society,
certainly as a field,

00:29:10.163 --> 00:29:14.121
engage in what what the shifts
we want to make to

00:29:14.121 --> 00:29:16.746
the social contract are to kind
of get through that in

00:29:16.746 --> 00:29:18.913
a way that is maximally beneficial
to everybody.

00:29:20.413 --> 00:29:22.621
I mean, in every past revolution,

00:29:22.663 --> 00:29:26.038
there's always been a space
for humans to move to.

00:29:26.038 --> 00:29:28.746
That is, if you like, moving
up the food chain,

00:29:28.746 --> 00:29:33.329
it's sort of we've retreated to the things
that humans could uniquely do,